# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# V1 suite redeploy — new program_vkey 0x00014cc4 / bitcoin_relay_vkey 0x00580f84
# Strategy: RESUME reflection from the current live tip; REUSE the existing factory.
# Public values only — NO private key here (pass the deployer key at broadcast).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Verifier + vkeys (pinned; scripts hard-check against elf-vkey-pin.json) ──
